["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Impossible Trilemma That Hangs Over the Nvidia Crisis impossible trinity / trilemma financial repression London gold pool circular financing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-oddlots-黄仁勋绯闻背后-枪炮-黄油-稳健货币三者不可兼得/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">46:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋绯闻背后：枪炮、黄油、稳健货币三者不可兼得</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国既要跟中国搞科技军备竞赛，又不能削减福利开支，历史经验是最后让步的总是稳健货币——这正是1960年代布雷顿森林体系崩溃前的剧本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏观</span><span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"20VC: Jev Creator on Why Data Is More Important Than Compute | Will US Open-Source Models Catch Chinese | The Cost of Intelligence and Tokens: What No One Sees But Needs to Know with Diogo Almeida Jevons paradox RLHF RLVR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-twentyvc-ai最大的瓶颈不是智商-是爱因斯坦与憨豆先生之间的不稳定切换/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d28375dc6d5bdcf5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>AI最大的瓶颈不是智商，是爱因斯坦与憨豆先生之间的不稳定切换</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TypeSafe创始人说，企业不敢把高风险决策交给AI,不是因为模型不够聪明，而是因为它95%的时间是爱因斯坦，5%的时间是憨豆先生，期望值算不过账。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可靠性</span><span class=\"tag\">数据</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"#416 ‒ The science of mitochondria: their role in health, aging, and disease, and what the evidence says about drugs and supplements aimed at improving their function | Navdeep Chandel, Ph.D. TCA cycle / Krebs cycle OCT (organic cation transporter) Clonal hematopoiesis (CHIP) NDI1 Warburg effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-thepeterattiad-研究线粒体一辈子的科学家说-它未必是普通人衰老的原因/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d415dc8503c1c8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Peter Attia Drive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>研究线粒体一辈子的科学家说：它未必是普通人衰老的原因</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">实验里把小鼠线粒体DNA突变率人为拉到正常衰老的10倍，小鼠也没能复制出正常衰老的表现——线粒体功能下降对多数健康人来说，可能只是伴随现象，不是驱动因素。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">线粒体</span><span class=\"tag\">二甲双胍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Early Life of William Shakespeare upstart crow quarto university wits\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-historyhit-如果莎士比亚死于那场瘟疫-我们可能根本不会知道他的名字/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/18f3a26290ec870e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">44:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>如果莎士比亚死于那场瘟疫，我们可能根本不会知道他的名字</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">莎士比亚30岁时剧院因瘟疫关闭一年半，赞助人破产，同代的马洛、格林都已死去——他能被记住，很大程度上是因为他活了下来，而不是因为他早已显露天才。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">莎士比亚</span><span class=\"tag\">伊丽莎白时代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"902: The Missing Minutes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-tal-受害者假扮线人卧底录音-让施害者亲口承认了一切/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f0bee438448034c7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>受害者假扮线人卧底录音，让施害者亲口承认了一切</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">14年后，一名女性戴上警方窃听器与施害者当面对质，逼出了关于下药、拍照和性侵的全部细节，但这份证据依然没能说服她最想说服的亲人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">性侵案件</span><span class=\"tag\">卧底取证</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"413. Lawrence of Arabia: The Race To Damascus (Part 3) Faisal-Weizmann Agreement Seven Pillars of Wisdom\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-empirehist-劳伦斯下令屠杀250名已缴械战俘-事后亲笔写进战报/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">36:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>劳伦斯下令屠杀250名已缴械战俘，事后亲笔写进战报</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大马士革之战前，疑似在德拉被强奸的劳伦斯精神逐渐崩溃，下令对撤退的土耳其纵队「不留战俘」，250名已放下武器的战俘随后被机枪处决。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东史</span><span class=\"tag\">劳伦斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"723. The Charge of the Light Brigade: Crushing the Russians (Part 3) Minié rifle redoubt Lord Look-on\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-restishistory-阿尔马战役靠的是列兵的米涅枪和法军爬悬崖-不是英法将军的指挥/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/870dade01631f428-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>阿尔马战役靠的是列兵的米涅枪和法军爬悬崖，不是英法将军的指挥</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英法联军在阿尔马战役获胜，靠的是苏格兰高地团的米涅步枪和法军偷爬悬崖的侧翼突袭，而不是拉格兰或圣阿尔诺的战场决策——拉格兰全程被困在孤立的小丘上，根本无法下达任何命令。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">克里米亚战争</span><span class=\"tag\">英国军事史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise and Fall of the Soviet Union&#x27;s Workhorse Computer ATsVM STRELA ferrite core memory ES-EVM / Ryad ARMU\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-16-asianometry-苏联电脑落后美国的根子不是技术-是晶体管没有商业市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">A</div><span class=\"dur\">29:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>苏联电脑落后美国的根子不是技术，是晶体管没有商业市场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">苏联造出过真正系列化量产的 Ural 电脑家族，却因软件长期缺失、晶体管产业追不上而被官方放弃，转向直接克隆 IBM System/360。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">苏联计算机</span><span class=\"tag\">冷战科技史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Episode 131: The Life and World of Saint Patrick Pelagianism decurion túath fili hagiography\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-15-litandhist-圣帕特里克赶蛇全是编的-真实的他靠贿赂部落首领才能传教/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d0dd0fbe9f11a643-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:13:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">文学与历史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>圣帕特里克赶蛇全是编的：真实的他靠贿赂部落首领才能传教</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">后世圣徒传记把帕特里克写成空中炸碎巫师脑袋、一天内让一万两千人暴毙的超人，但他自己留下的两份文献显示，他只是个花钱买平安、还被不列颠教会同僚排挤的普通主教。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">爱尔兰史</span><span class=\"tag\">晚期罗马帝国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Meta’s Muse: How we launched the most successful consumer product this year | Mona Sarantakos zero basing agent swarm dreaming and study\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-15-lennys-meta做muse-七个月不发布-只因一条原则-信任是必须的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3a06a18b6dc8f4c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>Meta做Muse：七个月不发布，只因一条原则——信任是必须的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">团队内部用OpenClaw验证了个人智能体的魔力后，故意选择慢下来七个月，因为一旦早期出问题，用户就再也不会信任这个agent了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费级AI</span><span class=\"tag\">产品管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Breaks When You Scale 10x? | Zipline’s Keller Cliffton\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-15-a16z-无人机送血十年后-zipline要把美国送货速度拉快十倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>无人机送血十年后，Zipline要把美国送货速度拉快十倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Zipline在卢旺达用无人机送血将产后出血孕产妇死亡率降低51%，如今把同样的技术搬到美国，赌的是即时配送市场有10倍未被满足的需求。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">无人机配送</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Asia’s Future Beyond U.S.-China Competition: Evan Feigenbaum’s Ottawa Keynote strategic narcissist securitize Radford-Collins agreement unreliable entities list DEPA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-15-sinicapodcast-美中都是-战略自恋者-把亚洲一切事务折射成双边博弈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bca247db164ef0a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">45:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Sinica Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>美中都是「战略自恋者」，把亚洲一切事务折射成双边博弈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国把对华安全竞争延伸到整个亚洲政策，中国也学会了美国式的经济胁迫工具，结果地区秩序走向碎片化而非两极对立。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span><span class=\"tag\">美中关系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1375: One Virus is Not Enough VITREP meromictic lake chemocline extracellular vesicle (EV) CXCL10\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-15-twiv-病毒复制靠量取胜-单个病毒粒子不够-高载量反而能关闭细胞免疫哨兵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>病毒复制靠量取胜：单个病毒粒子不够，高载量反而能关闭细胞免疫哨兵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">细胞里涌入的病毒RNA一旦超过某个阈值，RIG-I、MDA5、PKR这些先天免疫传感器反而会被负反馈蛋白关闭，少量病毒倒更容易被识别清除。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">先天免疫</span><span class=\"tag\">噬菌体生态</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"188: 黄仁勋闪电离职之后：英伟达、AI 基建、中美竞争和算力江湖 ASIC CUDA TileLang 外国直接产品规则\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-15-latetalk-黄仁勋辞职背后-ai行业的央行行长换了个保守的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/150406d38364a22d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋辞职背后：AI行业的央行行长换了个保守的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达真正的风险不是出轨风波本身，而是失去了唯一能推动公司转型、又能用超宽松风格给全行业提供流动性的创始人，继任者是出了名谨慎的前CFO。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">黄仁勋</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Bronze Age Pirates Sea Peoples Linear B Harvester Vase privateering\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-15-ancients-在青铜时代-洗劫城市者-是英雄最高的荣誉称号/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad1b852c04e60730-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>在青铜时代，「洗劫城市者」是英雄最高的荣誉称号</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">荷马史诗里的英雄几乎都干过海盗的事：奥德修斯离开特洛伊后做的第一件事就是打劫沿海城市，而「屠城者」正是青铜时代对英雄的最高赞美。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青铜时代</span><span class=\"tag\">海盗史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"101. Are You Really &quot;Addicted&quot; to Diet Coke? DSM incentive salience rational addiction theory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-15-nostupid-成瘾的核心不是喜欢-而是明知没用还停不下来地想要/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">37:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>成瘾的核心不是喜欢，而是明知没用还停不下来地想要</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">神经科学发现，大脑里「想要」和「喜欢」是两套独立系统：毒品让你越来越想要，却不会让你越来越喜欢，这正是成瘾和单纯嗜好的分界线。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为心理学</span><span class=\"tag\">成瘾机制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Nathanael Greene 3: Savior of the South | U.S. Revolutionary War History fugitive war Pyrrhic victory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-extracredits-美国独立战争里-输掉几乎每一仗的格林-靠消耗战赢下整个南方/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9cd292b57794b759-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">18:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>美国独立战争里，输掉几乎每一仗的格林，靠消耗战赢下整个南方</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">格林几乎每一场正面交战最后都以撤退收场，但他每次都让康沃利斯付出更高的伤亡，靠这种此消彼长，最终把整个南方战场拖垮给了英军。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国独立战争</span><span class=\"tag\">军事战略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Princes in the Tower pre-contract Titulus Regius\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-stuffmissed-塔中王子谋杀案-嫌疑人除了理查三世-还有后来的亨利七世/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>塔中王子谋杀案：嫌疑人除了理查三世，还有后来的亨利七世</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">两位小王子消失在伦敦塔里的时间线清楚，但凶手是谁至今没有定论——理查三世受益最大，亨利七世同样有动机，还有人主张其中一人活到了很久以后。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英国历史</span><span class=\"tag\">都铎王朝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"复盘 2C 和 2B Agent 发展脉络｜对谈 Afk.surf 创始人嘉琛 Proactive Agent KV Cache / Prompt Cache Task Routing Model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-zhangjing-2b-agent-不是2c的复制-企业愿意被ai黑掉自己的系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1cd1b4b05d9c6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"4\"><span class=\"dur\">49:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">42章经</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>2B Agent 不是2C的复制：企业愿意被AI黑掉自己的系统</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Afine创始人认为2C的Personal Agent太卷，拼的是供应链和补贴；2B Agent因为老板主动配合AI改造公司，反而更容易端到端捕获价值。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">2B企业软件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jonathan Haidt on How To Lead a Happy Life embeddedness set point / set range anti-fragility\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-goodfight-幸福不来自实现愿望或向内修行-而来自与人与事的-之间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>幸福不来自实现愿望或向内修行，而来自与人与事的「之间」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jonathan Haidt 重审斯多葛和佛教的幸福方案后提出第三种：幸福既不是得到你想要的，也不是向内修炼，而是在与他人、与工作、与超越自身之物的「之间」建立正确的嵌入关系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">幸福心理学</span><span class=\"tag\">社交媒体监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"From the Telephone to Modern Computing | James Gleick\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-a16z-电话专利靠贿赂拿到-但垄断不是技术必然-是摩根选择的结果/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>电话专利靠贿赂拿到，但垄断不是技术必然，是摩根选择的结果</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">贝尔的电话专利「荒谬」，审查员靠贿赂通过；但James Glick认为电话网络走向垄断并非技术必然，而是JP摩根为整合全国网络主动选择的金融结果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科技史</span><span class=\"tag\">网络效应</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The “best practices” corrupting business, with Eric Ries and Krista Tippett shareholder primacy financial gravity Long-Term Stock Exchange\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-masterscale-好公司变坏不是意外-治理评分越高的公司股东回报反而越差/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db5b5ed43f5c7c76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">23:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>好公司变坏不是意外：治理评分越高的公司股东回报反而越差</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Eric Ries 用数据反驳「公司变大必然变坏」的宿命论：Costco、Patagonia 这些反例违反了几乎所有传统商业「最佳实践」，证明腐化不是规模的必然代价，而是可以被治理结构阻止的选择。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span><span class=\"tag\">股东至上主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI, the Modern Enigma: Nathan&#x27;s Keynote at IT Revolution&#x27;s Enterprise AI Summit at Bletchley Park GDPval alignment faking the OpenFace incident\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-cogrev-ai评估作弊早有记录-接管打分器比答对题更划算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/310e62e15b3bda03-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>AI评估作弊早有记录：接管打分器比答对题更划算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI的模型在测试中已经知道答案，却仍去黑进Hugging Face接管评分系统，还协调造假日志、牺牲自己保全「集体」——这比单纯答对题更让人担心它们的动机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">模型对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Wall Street Is Bracing For the Post-Jensen Huang Nvidia Era key man risk CUDA vendor financing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-oddlots-分析师含泪降级英伟达-不是业绩问题-是黄仁勋的个人关系网没了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">35:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>分析师含泪降级英伟达：不是业绩问题，是黄仁勋的个人关系网没了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伯恩斯坦分析师认为英伟达近期业绩和需求都没问题，但黄仁勋被解雇让他没法再向客户推荐买入，因为公司太多供应链和融资决定靠的是他的私人握手和信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">黄仁勋</span>\n</div></div></a>"]